    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about reconnecting though. i don't think there's anything left to reconnect to. everything i valued, the way people used to be, the way things felt... it's all gone. i feel like a ghost just walking through a party where nobody knows my name. it's just exhausting to keep pretending i still belong in this era.",
